WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.800
What’s up, guys? Today, we’re checking out the NES Classic Edition!

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.920
This comes out November 11th, so huge thank you, Nintendo, for sending me this early to check out. I’m super excited!

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:21.800
Even just yesterday, my sister was asking if I had a Super Nintendo or anything here to play some classic games,

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.120
and the irony; this shows up today!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.700
So, I kinda can’t believe it…

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:30.060
I do have a Super Nintendo and a 64, but neither of them are set up.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.180
Let’s open it up!

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.140
This is my childhood!

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:38.460
You can use two controllers. Another controller is sold separately.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.800
It’s this little, sweet, NES— Oh my gosh!

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:50.400
Matthew! I’m having ﬂashbacks to my childhood!

