00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:12.860
HDMI cable.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.120
Power cord.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:19.560
Oh my god, this is tiny. This is like the size of an NES game.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:22.320
Like, this is the size of what the cartridges used to be like.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.680
Can you believe this?

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:27.420
Oh, wow… Holy moly.

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:45.180
Let’s set this thing up!

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:50.240
I can ﬁt all of these items in the palm of my hand.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.460
This is incredible.

