00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.800
Oh my god! If you hit reset, it gets you back to the—

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:23.800
I’m having, like, ﬂashbacks to my childhood when, like, you couldn’t save games.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.720
So, I would tell my mom, like, “You can’t touch this! You have to leave it on.”

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.500
And at the time, like, my parents, like, they always, still to this day,

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:35.380
